  "Rosa Parks seated toward the front of a Montgomery bus on 21 December 1956, when the boycott ended. This photograph records the later outcome, not the original refusal.": "1956年12月21日，抵制公交运动结束时，罗莎·帕克斯坐在蒙哥马利公交车前部。这张照片记录后来的结果，而非最初拒绝让座的现场。",
  "Photographic portrait of Anna Akhmatova, published by ABC. This is not a photograph of the prison queues.": "澳大利亚广播公司刊载的安娜·阿赫玛托娃肖像照片，并非监狱外排队人群的照片。",
  "Posthumous portrait of Copernicus, attributed to an unknown artist and dated to around 1580. No photograph could exist from his lifetime.": "约1580年由不知名画家绘制的哥白尼身后肖像。他生活的年代尚无摄影技术。",
  "Historical studio portrait identified as Harriet Jacobs. Photographed many years after the concealment described in her memoir.": "被标识为哈丽雅特·雅各布斯的历史影楼肖像，摄于其回忆录所述藏匿经历多年之后。",
  "Authenticated daguerreotype of Emily Dickinson as a teenager, circa 1847. This is an archival image, not an illustration.": "经确认的艾米莉·狄金森少女时期银版照片，约摄于1847年。这是历史影像，并非插画。",
  "Portrait of Alan Turing, 1951, by Elliott & Fry. Photographed before his 1952 conviction.": "埃利奥特与弗赖摄影室于1951年拍摄的艾伦·图灵肖像，早于他1952年被定罪。",
  "Claudette Colvin photographed as a teenager in 1953, before her March 1955 arrest. This is not a photograph of the arrest.": "克劳黛特·科尔文1953年少女时期的照片，早于1955年3月被捕，并非被捕现场照片。",
  "Oscar Wilde photographed by Napoleon Sarony around 1882, years before the 1895 trials.": "拿破仑·萨罗尼约于1882年拍摄的奥斯卡·王尔德照片，比1895年的审判早多年。",
