  "Archival photographs of Etty Hillesum from the Jewish Museum collection. The source article identifies an image dated 1939; the live preview may be unavailable.": "犹太博物馆收藏的埃蒂·希勒苏姆历史照片。来源文章标明其中一张照片摄于1939年；图片预览可能无法载入。",
  "Ida B. Wells, historic portrait; original papers and anti-lynching materials are held in the University of Chicago collection.": "艾达·B.威尔斯的历史肖像；其原始文稿及反私刑资料保存在芝加哥大学馆藏中。",
