  "Portrait of Rosalind Franklin (Elliott & Fry, 1946), predating Photograph 51.": "埃利奥特与弗赖摄影室1946年拍摄的罗莎琳德·富兰克林肖像，早于“照片51号”。",
  "Artemisia Gentileschi, Self Portrait as Saint Catherine of Alexandria (about 1615–17). Historical painting, not a documentary photograph of the trial.": "阿尔泰米西娅·真蒂莱斯基《扮作亚历山大的圣凯瑟琳的自画像》，约作于1615—1617年。这是历史绘画，并非审判现场的纪实照片。",
  "Portrait associated with the first edition of Elizabeth Keckley's memoir, 1868.": "与伊丽莎白·凯克利1868年回忆录初版相关的肖像。",
