  "Mary Berg's biography and original diary history are preserved by the Warsaw Ghetto Museum; image availability depends on the external archive.": "华沙隔都博物馆保存玛丽·贝格的生平资料及原始日记的历史；图片能否显示取决于外部档案网站。",
  "First page of Franz Kafka's 1919 letter to his father, shown as a facsimile.": "弗朗茨·卡夫卡1919年写给父亲的长信首页，以摹真影印形式展示。",
  "Abraham Lincoln's draft letter to George G. Meade, 14 July 1863. The letter was not sent.": "亚伯拉罕·林肯1863年7月14日写给乔治·G.米德的信稿。这封信没有寄出。",
