  "Surviving autograph signature attributed to the mathematician Sophie Germain. Used instead of an unverified later portrait.": "被归于数学家索菲·热尔曼的亲笔签名图像，代替未经确认的后世肖像。",
  "Portrait of Fanny Mendelssohn Hensel by Moritz Daniel Oppenheim, 1842.": "莫里茨·丹尼尔·奥本海姆1842年绘制的范妮·门德尔松·亨泽尔肖像。",
  "Historical photograph of Eileen Chang (Zhang Ailing), dated 1944.": "标注为1944年拍摄的张爱玲历史照片。",
