  "The Brontë sisters (Anne, Emily and Charlotte), painted by Branwell Brontë around 1834. This is a historical painting, not a photograph.": "布兰韦尔·勃朗特约于1834年绘制的勃朗特三姐妹安妮、艾米莉与夏洛蒂肖像。这是历史绘画，并非照片。",
  "Anne, Emily and Charlotte Brontë in a portrait by their brother Branwell, around 1834. Historical painting, not a photographic record.": "安妮、艾米莉与夏洛蒂·勃朗特，由她们的兄弟布兰韦尔约于1834年绘制。这是历史绘画，并非摄影记录。",
  "Title page of the 1811 first edition of Sense and Sensibility, showing 'By a Lady' instead of Jane Austen's name.": "1811年《理智与情感》初版的标题页，署名“一位女士所著”，并未写出简·奥斯汀的姓名。",
