  "Louisa May Alcott, around 1870, in an original nineteenth-century portrait photograph; not an image of her writing as A. M. Barnard.": "路易莎·梅·奥尔科特约1870年的十九世纪肖像照片，并非她以A. M.巴纳德为笔名写作时的现场影像。",
